      {
        "text": "Dr. Kisha E. McCaskill is the Cook County Commissioner for the 5th District, appointed in January 2025. She previously served as executive director of the Harvey Park District and as a school teacher, and holds a PhD in public administration and organizational leadership. In 2025, she passed a resolution addressing rising STI rates in the South Suburbs and proposed establishing a Level I trauma center in the region. She has worked to broaden health care services at clinics in Ford Heights, Robbins, and Blue Island. McCaskill names reducing high property taxes and addressing housing instability for seniors as key goals. Her campaign says she has sponsored or co-sponsored more than 100 resolutions.",
